The files in data and tests/data are converted from files of BeforeIT.jl
(data and test/matlab_code); see data/README.md and tests/data/README.md.

The changes with respect to BeforeIT.jl are described in README.md, section
"Differences from BeforeIT.jl".

src/plots.rs also follows errorline of StatsPlots.jl and mean and std of
NaNMath.jl, and uses the colours of the default palette of Plots.jl
(computed by PlotUtils.jl); these packages are under the MIT License.

